"I am Joaquin Denis, an independent web developer based in Torrent "
"(Valencia). With over 25 years of experience in IT and software development, "
"I specialize in building custom web applications with <a href=\"https://"
"www.djangoproject.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Django</b></"
"a> and <a href=\"https://www.python.org/\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\"><b>Python</b></a>."

